# Dream design theme

Source of truth: `framer-to-next-dream-main` (ported into `frontend/oracle`).

## Brand / marketing surfaces (light)

Warm parchment + terracotta. Prefer semantic tokens, not raw hex.

| Token | Role | Light value |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `background` | Page wash | `oklch(0.968 0.008 85)` |
| `foreground` | Body ink | `oklch(0.245 0.008 40)` |
| `primary` / `accent` | Terracotta CTA & accents | `oklch(0.4 0.135 25.8)` |
| `primary-foreground` | Text on terracotta | `oklch(0.985 0.006 85)` |
| `muted-foreground` | Secondary copy | `oklch(0.55 0.012 50)` |
| `ink` | Near-black button fill | `oklch(0.22 0.006 40)` |
| `ink-foreground` | Text on ink | `oklch(0.985 0.006 85)` |
| `surface` | Cards / panels | `oklch(0.985 0.005 85)` |
| `surface-tint` | Soft inset panels | `oklch(0.975 0.012 60)` |
| `border` | Hairlines | `oklch(0.905 0.012 70)` |

Defined in `frontend/oracle/packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css`.

## Typography

- Display: **Bodoni Moda** via `font-display` (headlines, hero, journal titles)
- UI / body: existing sans (`--font-sans`)
- Eyebrows: `eyebrow` utility (11px, 600, 0.14em, uppercase)
- Italic emphasis in hero: `before` uses `text-primary italic`

## Utilities

- `dotted-rule` — terracotta dashed connectors
- `animate-text-reveal` — hero mask wipe
- `animate-rise` — fade/slide up
- `animate-marquee` — infinite logo row (pause on `.group/marquee:hover`)

## Auth pages exception

`/login` and `/get-started` keep the **existing Clerk auth UI** (current dark shell + appearance). Do **not** restyle them to match the Dream marketing chrome unless explicitly asked.

## Dashboard

Dashboard stays on the **dark** theme tokens (`.dark`). Marketing routes force light via `LandingTheme`.
